    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pɛ̈ɛ̈n Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mɛmɛ cua jääk nhial dɔ̱diɛn nɛn, mi bëë piny nhial, tëëkɛ lua̱ŋ mi di̱i̱t. Kä cuɛ piny mɛr kɛ gɔɔy buɔyädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ciöt kɛ jɔw mi bum, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɔw dɔ̱diɛn mi bëë nhial liŋ, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kua̱r wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n, tin ca nyin leerä kä ci cieŋ agɔaa kɛ jɛ wiee ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä bikɛ jɛ par mi wäkɛ tol waŋädɛ nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ cuɔ̱ŋ nänä, kɛ ɣöö dualkɛ, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ cuɔ̱cdɛ nyuak, kä ɛ kɛn i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ ko̱kä wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n wiee kä parkɛ jɛ, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ ram mi kɔk kuakiɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thilɛ ram mi kɔk da̱a̱pdiɛn, kɛ ciɛk in bo̱r, kɛ guiy kɛnɛ dɔ̱a̱kni ti gɔw ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kɛ bieyni ti ca tak agɔaa, kɛ ti mɛ̈ri, kɛnɛ bieyni ti luaal, kɛ jiɛn diaal ti gɔw ŋuänydiɛn, kɛnɛ kuak diaal ti ca la̱t kɛ guɔ̱r, kɛ ti ca la̱t kɛ jiɛn ti di̱t kökdiɛn, kɛnɛ ciɛk in yian, kɛ yiëëth, amäni päm mi puɔth puɔth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ wal ti gɔw ŋuänydiɛn kɛ wal yi̱i̱rä, kɛnɛ wäl mi waŋkɛ, kɛ kɔaŋ, kɛnɛ liɛɛth, kɛ do̱o̱k kɛnɛ bɛl, kɛ ɣɔ̱k kɛnɛ rɔɔm, kɛ jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k kɛnɛ thurbiɛɛli ti yɔ̱a̱ckɛ, kɛ kuaany, tin la nɛy ti tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ji̱ ko̱kä jɛ jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kua̱r babuuri diaal, kɛ ja̱a̱l, kɛ la̱a̱t babuuri, kɛ nɛy diaal tin kɔ̱ŋ tin jëkɛ mi̱ethdiɛn rɛy bar, cukɛ cuɔ̱ŋ nänä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wiee mëë cikɛ tol waŋädɛ nɛn wäkɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk nhial mi bum päm mi ce̱tkɛ päm gua̱r mi di̱i̱t ka̱n, kä cuɛ jɛ yuɔr rɛy bar, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
